{"text":"景明三年五月卅日，比丘惠感爲亡父母敬造彌勒像一區。願國祚永隆，三寶彌顯。曠劫師僧、父母、眷屬，與三塗永乖，福鍾競集。三有群生，咸同此願。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"惠感","refId":null,"text":"惠感","start":11,"end":13},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":19,"end":21},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三寶","refId":null,"text":"三寶","start":31,"end":33},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量劫","refId":null,"text":"曠劫","start":36,"end":38},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三途","refId":null,"text":"三塗","start":48,"end":50},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三界","refId":null,"text":"三有","start":58,"end":60},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"群生","start":60,"end":62}]}